---
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Cloud as context.help Cloud
    participant Billing as Billing Service
    participant Payment as Payment Provider<br/>(Stripe)
    participant Node as User's Node

    Note over User,Node: Billing & Credits Flow

    User->>Cloud: Browse marketplace

    User->>Cloud: Subscribe to premium registry<br/>(Plan: $50/month)

    Cloud->>Billing: Create subscription<br/>user: user-123<br/>plan: premium-registry

    Billing->>Payment: Create subscription<br/>customer: cus_abc<br/>price: price_premium

    Payment-->>Billing: Subscription created<br/>sub_xyz123

    Billing->>Billing: Allocate initial credits:<br/>100 credits/month

    Billing->>Cloud: Subscription active<br/>Credits: 100

    Cloud-->>User: ✓ Subscription active

    Note over User,Node: User consumes credits via node

    User->>Node: ctxt search --registry premium<br/>"patterns"

    Node->>Cloud: Check entitlements
    Cloud-->>Node: Granted (95 credits remaining)

    Node->>Node: Execute operation

    Node->>Cloud: POST /metering/events<br/>{quantity: 5 credits}

    Cloud->>Billing: Record usage<br/>5 credits consumed

    Billing->>Billing: Update balance:<br/>100 → 95 credits

    Note over User,Node: Monthly billing cycle

    Payment->>Billing: Webhook: invoice.payment_succeeded

    Billing->>Billing: Reset credit balance:<br/>95 → 100 credits (new cycle)

    Billing->>Cloud: Update user credits

    Cloud->>Node: Sync entitlements<br/>(if node online)

    Note over User,Node: Overage scenario

    User->>Node: Heavy usage this month

    Node->>Cloud: Check entitlements
    Cloud-->>Node: Granted (2 credits remaining)

    User->>Node: Large operation<br/>(needs 10 credits)

    Node->>Cloud: Check entitlements
    Cloud-->>Node: Denied (insufficient credits)

    Node-->>User: ❌ Insufficient credits<br/>2 remaining, 10 required

    User->>Cloud: Purchase credit top-up<br/>(+50 credits for $10)

    Cloud->>Billing: Add credits: +50

    Billing-->>Cloud: Credits: 52

    Cloud->>Node: Sync entitlements

    User->>Node: Retry operation

    Node->>Cloud: Check entitlements
    Cloud-->>Node: Granted (52 credits)

    Node->>Node: Execute operation
    Node-->>User: ✓ Success
```
